11:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"cargo test --all --profile=smol"}]," is the fast inner loop, but a green Cargo\nrun is not a green CI: ",["$","code",null,{"children":"bazel test"}]," attaches rustfmt and clippy aspects that\nCargo does not. See ",["$","$L2a",null,{"href":"/contribute/testing-guide","children":"the testing guide"}]," for what\nthe suites contain and which local failures are environmental."]}]
